  "headline": "Ephedrine sulfate is not on FDA's shortage list; supply traces to a registered plant last inspected VAI 2024-07-25",
  "headline_cites": ["D3", "E9"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list does not include ephedrine sulfate as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Both Corvale sites use product labeled by Gland Pharma Limited (NDC 68083061010).",
      "cites": ["E1", "E2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The registered manufacturing plant is Gland Pharma Limited (FEI 3002647489) in India.",
      "cites": ["E9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA's most recent inspection of that plant ended 2024-07-25 and was classified VAI.",
      "cites": ["E8", "E9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has 6.6 days of 5 mg/mL 10 mL vials on hand; Corvale General has 18.6 days.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The top-ranked option is to transfer 27 vials from Corvale General to Corvale East, leaving the sender with 14 days and the receiver with 12 days.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Alternate manufacturers include Fresenius Kabi USA, LLC (plant last inspected VAI 2024-03-21) and NorthStar RxLLC (plant last inspected VAI 2022-10-29).",
      "cites": ["D5", "D6"]
    }
  ]
}
